{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>油塘油麗邨發生火警。今日（15日）上午10時49分，油麗邨秀麗樓一單位起火，多人報警求助，逾百人疏散；其中涉事單位住戶報稱與兒子被困室內、另有約20名住戶亦報稱被困於後樓梯，幸其後安全獲救。</p><p>消防員到場出動一條喉及一煙帽隊灌救，約29分鐘後大致將火救熄。火警中，初步有5名傷者，其中71歲姓林婦人為起火單位住戶，她清醒由救護車送往聯合醫院；另外4人均無大礙，毋須送院。</p><figure><img alt=\"起火單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads / le_ronica 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187367628545462272145786.jpeg/SJd84q19GYOnVSWEJ67LjJba8qy6n8eFH1c77h9XO-4\"/><figcaption>起火單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads / le_ronica 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>據了解，起火單位位於9樓，有同層住客憶述火警一刻濃煙密佈，走火警後仍驚魂未定，「驚呀！而家手腳仲軟緊！」</p><figure><img alt=\"大批居民疏散。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187367432142983168641890.jpeg/6uJrohaHcCFLHEf6s430LRnhUVhqcXO3uaLb8pCi2_I\"/><figcaption>大批居民疏散。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批居民疏散。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187373853525938176508134.jpeg/6jckObNRxSBEeDv3CHReeIKyRaqGRxnJaoaMHEOGjBw\"/><figcaption>大批居民疏散。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批居民疏散。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187373857498075136059486.jpeg/zDEVluBOfxXF8alqPzDJsXuReXkXQAMhaXVpykB1aco\"/><figcaption>大批居民疏散。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為油麗邨秀麗樓，消防員到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187367463353323520845306.jpeg/ngCvMrndH6oTPe4Ec7ArOYOdTIo1udnSzBe6--UXuvs\"/><figcaption>現場為油麗邨秀麗樓，消防員到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為油麗邨秀麗樓，起火單位外牆嚴重熏黑。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187367460350070784750964.jpeg/Q9nLmUu9in-WXt_HDLQXFKeSI4dzMRX34cdxmMjHcZg\"/><figcaption>現場為油麗邨秀麗樓，起火單位外牆嚴重熏黑。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為油麗邨秀麗樓，消防員到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187367450245599232915328.jpeg/1ujQ_-ShowUxYlOahe78umXfP1O6OiOI6mEW1MNhFtQ\"/><figcaption>現場為油麗邨秀麗樓，消防員到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為油麗邨秀麗樓，消防員到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187367453961883648764213.jpeg/Qc1NtWZXgEc2vTpsz5-sQnuITT82QD0oBxKO2y4Sjts\"/><figcaption>現場為油麗邨秀麗樓，消防員到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><p>警方稱經初步調查相信，上址有風扇燈懷疑電線短路引致火警，現階段並無證據顯示案件涉及刑事成分。該名姓林71歲女住戶吸入濃煙不適，清醒被送往基督教聯合醫院治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場為油麗邨秀麗樓，消防員到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187367463353323520845306.jpeg/ngCvMrndH6oTPe4Ec7ArOYOdTIo1udnSzBe6--UXuvs\"/><figcaption>現場為油麗邨秀麗樓，消防員到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"起火單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads / le_ronica 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187365238899478528571460.jpeg/sSGmU9qxXjOfUhQlSppsI0RoNNwvTWErZzFjKGcxYyg\"/><figcaption>起火單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads / le_ronica 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"起火單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads / le_ronica 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187365241269391360437519.jpeg/gBNAhVT7E6LMqNmLu-EZTj1z2314oUWLaW4vFGluLxQ\"/><figcaption>起火單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads / le_ronica 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場冒出大量濃煙。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187362875790856192128947.jpeg/pSgZch0f_W9cCUCa_ZKhyiwEl0sNmW4jYQ-fnWEPn50\"/><figcaption>現場冒出大量濃煙。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.076822+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":616,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T03:24:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:38:03.262301+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:09.981392+00:00","content_hash":"6b8c749e3dd0798bee4277167ecb3f690b1a6b0737ebfe0d8b2f7a23bbb3cf65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}